{"unit_id":"shaoshi20__dshscan#feature-1","repo":"shaoshi20/dshscan","commit":"f526390acac3ef7b45d62c65fa55d07e3a020702","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DShScan 的功能「多类型源码扫描」：可检查本地目录、ZIP、Markdown、GitHub 仓库或索引插件。运行扫描后生成带规则命中和证据的结果，离线模式可跳过远程仓库克隆。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/scanner.ts:1209-1285","src/scanner.ts:1409-1458"]}
